  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Hi,",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "i've found this bug. When i MOVE a content from URI to other URI the original Solr index still remain indexed.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -u fedoraAdmin:secret3 -X MOVE -H \"Destination: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://172.17.0.2:8080/fcrepo/rest/TRX_OFFLINE/TEST_00000000030"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://172.17.0.2:8080/fcrepo/rest/TRX_OFFLINE/TEST_00000000030",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\" \"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://172.17.0.2:8080/fcrepo/rest/TRX/TEST_00000000030"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://172.17.0.2:8080/fcrepo/rest/TRX/TEST_00000000030",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This command generate a delete request on Solr, by karaf, but with an invalid ID",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "karaf.log",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "2018-01-11 22:48:40,767 | INFO | Consumer[fedora] | SolrRouter | 245 - org.fcrepo.camel.fcrepo-indexing-solr - 4.7.2 | Deleting Solr Object info:fedora/TRX/TEST_00000000041",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "why just in MOVE command Fedora prepend a info:fedora into uri?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Ovviusly in Solr nothing are found (for delete):",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "solr.log",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "INFO - 2018-01-11 22:48:40.769; org.apache.solr.update.processor.LogUpdateProcessor; [collection1] webapp=/solr path=/update params={commitWithin=10000} {delete=[info:fedora/TRX/TEST_00000000041 (-1589338094456274944)]} 0 0",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The add in Solr works (same MOVE call)",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "karaf.log",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "2018-01-11 22:48:40,771 | INFO | Consumer[fedora] | SolrRouter | 245 - org.fcrepo.camel.fcrepo-indexing-solr - 4.7.2 | Indexing Solr Object ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://172.17.0.2:8080/fcrepo/rest/TRX_OFFLINE/TEST_00000000041"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://172.17.0.2:8080/fcrepo/rest/TRX_OFFLINE/TEST_00000000041",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "solr.log",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "INFO - 2018-01-11 22:48:40.869; org.apache.solr.update.processor.LogUpdateProcessor; [collection1] webapp=/solr path=/update params={commitWithin=10000} {add=",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://172.17.0.2:8080/fcrepo/rest/TRX_OFFLINE/TEST_00000000041 (1589338094557986816)"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://172.17.0.2:8080/fcrepo/rest/TRX_OFFLINE/TEST_00000000041 (1589338094557986816)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": "} 0 3",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Anyone can help me?",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's a BUG?",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "The DELETE works, same for PUT.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Thanks and regards",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
